description: |
  Retrieves a list of exception rules applied to endpoints (also known as XDR agents) based on provided filters. Note: Due to a value constraint on the result size, the data returned may be partial and not reflect the complete set of matching results.
display: Cortex - List Endpoint Exception Rules
isdetailsoverridden: false
locked: false
name: CortexListEndpointExceptionRules
